<title>USA: PepsiCo to name restaurant head soon.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo to name restaurant head soon.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc said Tuesday that it plans to announce in the next couple of weeks the head of the new restaurant company it will spin off later this year.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Viacom Inc said that it has named John Antioco, who was president and chief executive officer of Pepsi's Taco Bell unit, chairman and chief executive officer of Viacom's Blockbuster unit.  </p>
<p>In January, PepsiCo said it would spin off its restaurant business, composed of its KFC, Pizza Hut and Taco Bell restuarants, by the end of 1997.</p>
</text>
